          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Mean: $\\mu = \\sum x P(x) = 0.16+0.38+0.66+0.84+0.60+0.60 = 3.24$. Second moment: $E(X^2) = \\sum x^2 P(x) = 0.16+0.76+1.98+3.36+3.00+3.60 = 12.86$. Variance: $\\sigma^2 = E(X^2) - \\mu^2 = 12.86 - 3.24^2 = 12.86 - 10.4976 = 2.3624 \\approx 2.36$. (12.86 is $E(X^2)$ — the classic trap; 9.62 is $\\mu^2$ subtracted the wrong way round is not it either.)</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Kỳ vọng: $\\mu = \\sum x P(x) = 0{,}16+0{,}38+0{,}66+0{,}84+0{,}60+0{,}60 = 3{,}24$. Mô men bậc hai: $E(X^2) = \\sum x^2 P(x) = 0{,}16+0{,}76+1{,}98+3{,}36+3{,}00+3{,}60 = 12{,}86$. Phương sai: $\\sigma^2 = E(X^2) - \\mu^2 = 12{,}86 - 3{,}24^2 = 12{,}86 - 10{,}4976 = 2{,}3624 \\approx 2{,}36$. (12,86 chính là $E(X^2)$ — bẫy kinh điển vì quên trừ $\\mu^2$.)</p></div>"
